page('SOURCES / EDITION NOTES','BUILT FROM THE EXISTING IDENTITY','An identity to work with.',cols(para('Edition 01 translates the existing OSF brand system into a visual reference, dated 10 September 2026.','lead')+para('The 26-page format and subject sequence take inspiration from the supplied ISCC guide. The identity, copy, artwork and practical rules here come from OSF sources and this edition’s clearly labelled application studies.')+tag('DESIGN CREDITS')+para('Visual identity: Martin Golombek.<br>Identity realisation and founding website graphic design: Tom Walsh / Prolog.<br>Credits follow the OSF People page.','small')+tag('RIGHTS &amp; EDITION')+para('Guide prose: CC BY 4.0. Original logo artwork retains the OSF Brand Assets Permission. Website animation artwork and films retain their existing rights. Source code retains its scoped licences. Font software is not distributed.','small'),'<div class="sources">'+block('01 / BRAND AUTHORITY','OSF brand repository',f'<a href="{REPO}">Open-Science-Foundation-brand-guide</a><br>Base commit e97831e. Guide, tokens and original logos.')+block('02 / WEBSITE SOURCE','opening.science', '<a href="https://opening.science">Foundation website</a> · <a href="https://opening.science/people/">People and credits</a><br>Source: Opening-Science/homepage @ 282a767.<br>Canonical theme unchanged from the recorded snapshot.')+block('03 / ACCESSIBILITY','WCAG 2.2', '<a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/contrast-minimum.html">Text contrast, SC 1.4.3</a><br><a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/non-text-contrast.html">Non-text contrast, SC 1.4.11</a>')+block('04 / TYPE','Maxitype &amp; Dinamo','<a href="https://maxitype.com/eula/">Selecta / Maxitype EULA</a><br><a href="https://abcdinamo.com/licenses">ABC Diatype Semi Mono / Dinamo</a>')+'</div>'),cls='ending')

